[TITLE]
NUM-08: open storage S1 (1000 ft2, 10 ft deep, no surcharge depth, no ponding)
filled by 100 cfs for 5 min, then no inflow; fixed 30 s routing step.
S1 has no links, so it fills, floods, and stops flooding before the run ends.
J1-C1-O1 is only there because SWMM needs an outfall.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             00:20:00
REPORT_STEP          00:00:30
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         30
VARIABLE_STEP        0

[JUNCTIONS]
J1     0    5        0         0        0

[OUTFALLS]
O1     -1   FREE

[STORAGE]
;;Name Elev MaxD InitD Shape     A1 A2 A0   SurDepth Fevap
S1     0    10   0     FUNCTIONAL 0  0  1000 0        0

[CONDUITS]
C1     J1  O1  100  0.013  0  0  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
C1     CIRCULAR 1 0 0 0 1

[INFLOWS]
S1  FLOW  TS1  FLOW 1.0 1.0 0

[TIMESERIES]
TS1  0:00  100
TS1  0:05  100
TS1  0:05:01  0
TS1  0:20  0

[REPORT]
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
